    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gălērītus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>that wears a hood.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prima galeritus posuit praetoria Lygmon,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a peasant</i>, <i>rustic</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 1, 29.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: galerita avis, <i>the
				crested lark</i>, Alauda cristata, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				37, 44, § 121</span></i>; <i><span class="en">30, 7, 20, §
			62</span></i>; called also, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">galeritus</span></b> , i,
				m. (sc. ales), <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 76</span></i>
			Müll.</div>
